    "## Cell 09 — Step 2: Standardize strings and preserve raw fields\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why\n",
    "Before applying rules, we normalize text and create raw helper columns.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business value\n",
    "This makes later transformations safer and easier to audit.\n"
