  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ef8a6103",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Cell 20 — Build the pipeline funnel\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why\n",
    "A funnel summarizes how the dataset shrinks from messy input to trusted output.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Business value\n",
    "This is a high-value governance and teaching artifact.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 45,
   "id": "1fe8316e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
