   "source": [
    "## Cell 26 — OLAP 2: Monthly sales trend\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why\n",
    "This reveals seasonality and trend patterns in trusted sales.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Plot interpretation\n",
    "The line helps detect high and low periods. Peaks may correspond to demand spikes or seasonal effects.\n"
   ]
  },
