    "## Cell 27 — OLAP 3: Profit by store location\n",
    "\n",
    "### Why\n",
    "This compares profitability across store locations.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Plot interpretation\n",
    "A larger slice or bar indicates a stronger profit contribution from that store location.\n"
   ]
  },
